  entries:
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: df58ce550d446d847ba3ac2c700cb826, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Long-range sensors are picking up movement beyond the perimeter.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: df58ce550d446d847ba3ac2c700cb826, type: 3}
    dialogueText: I recommend stockpiling iron reserves and researching defensive
      wall structures.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Kyra-Dominia
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: ec3af396638fb02499ed390d58ca0309, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 3622792381989719942, guid: fcfdf3b0b75479b45ac4992a42f44486, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Agreed. I want walls up before whatever is out there decides to
      pay us a visit.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
